    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mongo kūfuma mu hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ng'wenūyo ūnishosha ū kū nyango gwa hekalu, nūbona minzī galīzwīlīīla kūfuma hasī a ha nyango gwa hekalu, hama gaahūūma galolile kīya (nguno ī hekalu yalī īlolelile kīya). A minzī genayo gafumīīlaga kū lwande lo dakama ya hekalu, dakama ya ng'walīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūnibītya kū mita go sukuma ūnenha hanze, tūbītīla hanze anitongeelile tūjile, tūūkashika kū mita go hanze ūyo gūlolelile kīya; a minzī gahūūmaga gafumile kū lwande lo dakama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walī na nang'ha gwa kūpimīla ū mu nkono gwakwe, ūshimīza alolile kīya, hūna ūpima būkūle bo nusu kilomita; ūnitonga tūūbīta mo ū mu minzī, gaalī ga mu shing'ongwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūpima hangī būkūle bo nusu kilomita, ūnitonga hangī tūūbīta mo ū mu minzī; gūbiza na būshimu bo kūshisha mu mazwi. Ūpima hangī nusu kilomita, ūnitonga hangī tūūbīta moi; gūūshika mu nkīmbīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūpima hangī nusu kilomita, lelo gūbiza mongo ūyo naalī natadūgije ū kūgūkīla, nguno a minzī gaalī mingī no, hangī mashimu ga kwigela munhū kūjiha mo; mongo ūyo atīho wa kūgūkīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūnibūūja, “Ng'wana wa munhū, ūlīyībona ī yenīyī?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho nashika koi nūbona mitī mingī ū kū ngegu ja mongo jose būbīlī wajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūniwīla, “A minzī geneya gakahūūmaga gajile kū sī ja kīya, gajile kūshisha kū ntubīlo gwa Alaba, kūja kwingīla mu nyanza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nyanza:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Īyo īlīhayiwa Nyanza ya Munhu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ūlū gingīla ū mu nyanza, a minzī ga nyanza yenīyo gakagalūkaga gaabiza manweki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gaabiza manweki:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, gaabeela.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī kwene ūko gūhūūmīīla ū mongo shiseeng'wa na shiseeng'wa shikūbiza shipanga. Nī ndīlo jikūkwīla no, nguno a minzī genaya galīhūūma gajile koi, gakagagalūcha a minzī ga munhu kūbiza manweki. Hūna lūūlū būlī kwene ūko gūhūūma gūjile ū mongo būlī shikolo shikūbizī shipanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bategi ba ndīlo bakwihela ū mu ngegu; kwandīja Engedi kūja En-eglaimu gakūbiza ho mabbaala ga kwanikīgīja mitego. Ī ndīlo jikūbiza ja mbika na mbika, gīt'ūmò jilī ndīlo ja mu Nyanza Nhaale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47:10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nyanza Nhaale:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, Nyanza ya Sanjo; nu mu ng'hi 15,19, ni 20.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a mataba ga mu mhelo mhelo na a malutende gatūbeela, a gene gakūlekanījiwa gikale na munhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mitī ya matwajo ya būlī mbika īkūkūla ū kū ngegu ja mongo būbīlī wajo. A madūūtū gayo gatūnyaala, nī shisuumo shayo ītūholoosha. Būlī ng'weji īkūyūtwaja nguno a minzī ga kūfuma h'ipandī lyeela gakūhūmīīlaga ūko īlī. Ī shisuumo shayo shikūbiza shilīwa, a madūūtū gayo gakūbiza ga kūlagūlīla.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūtūūlwa mīmbī ja sī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, “Īji h'ī mbīmbī ījo ūkūjitūmamīla ū kwīgaba ī sī kūlwa wingīji bo ng'anda ikūmi n'ibīlī ja Isilaeli, ū lo Yosefu migabo ībībī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nakalahīla na nkono gūnunjiwe ng'wigūlya, gīkī nakūbinha a bakūlūgenji bing'we ī sī yenīyī. Ī yoi īkūbiza ying'we kūlwa wingīji wing'we; ūkūbagabanhya mu būlenganīja.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū hū lūkūbiza lūbīmbī lwayo ī sī: Ū kū lwande lo sukuma lūkwandīja kū Nyanza Nhaale lūūlondeela ikūūwa lya Hesiloni lūūbīta lūjile Lebo-Hamasi, kūja Zedadi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Belosa, Sibulaimu (kū lūbīmbī lwa Damasiko na Hamasi), kūshisha Hazeli-hatikoni, nzengo gwa mu lūbīmbī lwa Haulani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūbīmbī lūkwandīja kū nyanza lūūbīta lūjile kūshisha Hazali-enani, ū kū lwande lwa sukuma yaho īlīho Damasiko na Hamasi. Ū lwenūlū hū lūkūbiza lūbīmbī lo sukuma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kū lwande lo kīya ū lūbīmbī lūkūbīta ha gatī ya Haulani na Damasiko lūlondeela mongo gwa Yolodani, lūja lūlikilimbīja Gileadi na sī ya Isilaeli, kūja kū nyanza ya kīya hūna lūūnyamuka lūjile kūshisha Tamali. Ū lwenūlū hū lūkūbiza lūbīmbī lo kīya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
